/// for runtime reflection in Dart without dart:mirrors.
///
/// ## Main Entry Point
///
/// - [ReflectionApi] - Main API for type lookup, filtering, processing
/// - [PackageApi] - Scoped API for a specific package
/// - [LibraryApi] - Scoped API for a specific library
