/// - [GenericElement] - Type parameter support
/// - [Accessible] - Field and property value access
///
/// ## Type Mirrors
///
/// - [TypeMirror] - Base class for all type mirrors
/// - [ClassMirror] - Reflects classes with members, constructors, type info
